    "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
    "Operator Specs:\n"
    "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
    "The operator specs describe the action to be performed by cct, e.g:\n"
    "\n"
    "        +proj=utm  +ellps=GRS80  +zone=32\n"
    "\n"
    "instructs cct to convert input data to Universal Transverse Mercator, zone 32\n"
